{
  "name": "Runic Mastery (Rune Mage)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You add Symbol to your spellbook and it doesn't count against the number of prepared spells for you. When you cast the spell, you can choose a number of creatures equal to your Intelligence modifier. The chosen creatures are exempt from the spell's effect when it is triggered.</p><p>Additionally, you can cast the spell without a spell slot and without material components. You cannot do so again until you have finished a Long Rest.</p>",
